        "id": "ch10_6-1",
        "text": "Questions\n1.\nHow do agentic systems in creative applications differ from traditional generative AI tools?\nDiscuss with an example from the chapter.\n2.\nIn the context of manufacturing cell orchestration, explain how multiple agents work together\nand why this approach is more effective than traditional automation systems.\n3.\nCompare and contrast the role of agentic systems in robotics versus decision support systems.\nHow do their approaches to maintaining context differ?\n4.\nUsing the enterprise knowledge management use case from the chapter, explain how different\nagents collaborate to solve complex information retrieval problems.\n5.\nThe chapter discussed the supply chain optimization network as a use case. What are the key\nadvantages of using an agentic system approach in this context, and how do the different agents\ncomplement each other?\nAnswers\n237",
